<title>THAILAND: Siam City third quarter net up 55.20 pct.</title>
<headline>Siam City third quarter net up 55.20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>Third quarter</p>
<p>    Net		    804.03	   vs	 518.07</p>
<p>Nine Months</p>
<p>    Net		  2,522.93	   vs     2,117.15</p>
<p>MOTE: Revenues not stated. Bank's full name is Siam City Bank Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
